# Topology: all transient + durable agent state lives under one mount point,
# .scratch/{work,worktrees,sketches} (cohesion campaign D5). This single entry
# covers the disposable working sets, the default worktree substrate, and the
# durable sketch subrepo once relocated there.
.scratch/

# Transition guards: legacy root locations pending the physical move under
# .scratch/. Remove each line only once its directory has been relocated, so the
# live subrepo / worktree is never accidentally un-ignored mid-migration.
.sketches/
.worktrees/

# Unrelated tooling and caches.
.antigravitycli/
.prior_art_cache/
__pycache__/
